# account: the closed list of states of the machine "Account and quota".
# value<TAB>mark (initial, final or -)<TAB>kind (active, waiting, rest, final)<TAB>meaning
available	initial	rest	signed in, and nobody uses it
in-use	-	active	one worker or more uses it
limited	-	rest	its quota is used up until a reset time
signed-out	-	waiting	its login does not work
retired	final	final	it is out of the pool for good
